{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52850","headline":"句 · 杨贵妃","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迎娘歌喉玉䆗窱，蛮儿舞带金葳蕤。\n（《断肠诗集前集》卷六《会魏夫人席上……》郑元佐注引《羣玉杂俎》引《杨妃外传》引。\n今本《杨妃外传》无此二句。\n诗当出依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨贵妃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}